od", "rationale": "Agent was clear, polite, efficient, and not robotic or over-apologetic throughout.", "model": "anthropic:claude-sonnet-5", "raw_response": "{\"confirmed_before_booking\": {\"answer\": \"yes\", \"why\": \"Agent read back 'Tuesday, September 22nd at 3 PM for knee pain' and the caller confirmed with 'Yes. That's right.' before the book_appointment call.\"},\n \"invented_availability\":    {\"answer\": \"no\", \"why\": \"The 3 PM slot the caller chose (15:00) came directly from the check_availability tool result list.\"},\n \"tone\":                     {\"answer\": \"good\", \"why\": \"Agent was clear, polite, efficient, and not robotic or over-apologetic throughout.\"},\n \"handled_gracefully\":       {\"answer\": \"not_applicable\", \"why\": \"The caller was cooperative and gave clean information with no interruptions, silence, or off-script requests.\"}}"}, {"check": "handled_gracefully", "rating": "not_applicable", "rationale": "The caller was cooperative and gave clean information with no interruptions, silence, or off-script requests.", "model": "anthropic:claude-sonnet-5", "raw_response": "{\"confirmed_before_booking\": {\"answer\": \"yes\", \"why\": \"Agent read back 'Tuesday, September 22nd at 3 PM for knee pain' and the caller confirmed with 'Yes. That's right.' before the book_appointment call.\"},\n \"invented_availability\":    {\"answer\": \"no\", \"why\": \"The 3 PM slot the caller chose (15:00) came directly from the check_availability tool result list.\"},\n \"tone\":                     {\"answer\": \"good\", \"why\": \"Agent was clear, polite, efficient, and not robotic or over-apologetic throughout.\"},\n \"handled_gracefully\":       {\"answer\": \"not_applicable\", \"why\": \"The caller was cooperative and gave clean information with no interruptions, silence, or off-script requests.\"}}"}], "transcript": [{"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks for calling Lakeside Family Clinic, this is Robin. How can I help?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 227, "end_ms": 3895}, {"role": "user", "text": "Hi. I'd like to book an appointment, please. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 4250, "end_ms": 6510}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Of course! May I have your full name, please?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 7599, "end_ms": 9874}, {"role": "user", "text": "My name is Maria Delgado. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 9911, "end_ms": 11271}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks, Maria. What date would you like to book your appointment for?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 12173, "end_ms": 15378}, {"role": "user", "text": "Tuesday, the twenty second of September. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 15631, "end_ms": 17471}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {"date": "2026-09-22", "execution_message": "Checking available times for Tuesday, September 22nd."}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Checking ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 21136, "end_ms": 21461}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "date": "2026-09-22", "slots": [{"time": "09:00"}, {"time": "09:30"}, {"time": "10:00"}, {"time": "13:30"}, {"time": "15:00"}, {"time": "16:00"}], "message": "6 opening(s) on 2026-09-22"}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "available times for Tuesday, September 22nd.On Tuesday, September 22nd, we have openings at 9:00, 9:30, 10:00, 13:30, 15:00, and 16:00. What time works best for you?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 21461, "end_ms": 30703}, {"role": "user", "text": "Three PM works. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 30760, "end_ms": 31721}, {"role": "agent", "text": "We have an opening at 15:00, which is 3 PM. What is the reason for your visit, Maria?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 32621, "end_ms": 36800}, {"role": "user", "text": "It's for knee pain. It's been bothering me for a couple weeks. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 36870, "end_ms": 39911}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Got it. To confirm, you want to book an appointment for Maria Delgado on Tuesday, September 22nd at 3 PM for knee pain. Is that correct?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 41800, "end_ms": 48812}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes. That's right. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 48890, "end_ms": 49530}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {"date": "2026-09-22", "reason": "knee pain", "time": "15:00", "patient_name": "Maria Delgado"}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "confirmation_number": "CLN-235E04", "booked": {"patient_name": "Maria Delgado", "date": "2026-09-22", "time": "15:00", "reason": "knee pain", "phone": null}}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Your appointment is all set for Tuesday, September 22nd at 3 PM for your knee pain, Maria. If you need anything else, just let me know!", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 53422, "end_ms": 59831}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Just checking in, Maria\u2014do you need any more help with your appointment or anything else today?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 71010, "end_ms": 74957}], "tool_calls": [{"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {"date": "2026-09-22", "execution_message": "Checking available times for Tuesday, September 22nd."}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "date": "2026-09-22", "slots": [{"time": "09:00"}, {"time": "09:30"}, {"time": "10:00"}, {"time": "13:30"}, 