role": "agent", "text": "Just to confirm, you mean Thursday the 17th of September, 2026?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 5211, "end_ms": 9112}, {"role": "user", "text": "Dave O and KWO? ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 9198, "end_ms": 10318}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Could you please spell your full name for ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 13062, "end_ms": 14397}, {"role": "user", "text": "Nine m. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 14298, "end_ms": 14858}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I want to make sure I got that right. You said your appointment time is 9 AM, correct? Also, could you please spell your full name for me?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 17656, "end_ms": 23507}, {"role": "user", "text": "Just a flu shot. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 23618, "end_ms": 24418}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks. So far I have: the date Thursday, September 17th, 2026, the time 9 AM, and the reason is a flu shot. I still need your full name to proceed. Could you please spell it?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 25563, "end_ms": 35826}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yep. Correct. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 35928, "end_ms": 36488}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I still need your full name to complete the booking. Could you please spell your full name for me?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 37724, "end_ms": 41996}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes. That's correct. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 41858, "end_ms": 42738}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I want to make sure I have everything right before I check availability. You want an appointment on Thursday, September 17th, 2026, at 9 AM, for a flu shot. Could you please provide your full name spelled out?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 43519, "end_ms": 53086}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes. That's correct. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 52968, "end_ms": 54008}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I still need your full name spelled out to proceed with checking availability. Could you please provide that?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 55016, "end_ms": 60031}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes. That's correct. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 59908, "end_ms": 60788}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I understand you confirmed the date, time, and reason. However, I still need your full name spelled out to check availability and book the appointment. Could you please provide your full name?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 61697, "end_ms": 70753}], "tool_calls": [], "captured_slots": {}, "followups_used": 3, "error": null}
