n Thursday at 9:00, 9:30, 10:00, 11:00 in the morning, and 3:00 or 4:00 in the afternoon. What time works best for you? Also, may I have your name and the reason for your visit?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 5654, "end_ms": 18609}, {"role": "user", "text": "Dave O and KWO? ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 18752, "end_ms": 19872}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks, Dave. Just to ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 21245, "end_ms": 22394}, {"role": "user", "text": "Nine ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 22532, "end_ms": 22851}, {"role": "agent", "text": "confirm, you ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 22394, "end_ms": 22916}, {"role": "user", "text": "m. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 22851, "end_ms": 23012}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Got it, Dave. You'd like an appointment at 9:00 AM on Thursday, September 17th. And the reason is KWO. Is that correct?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 24646, "end_ms": 31148}, {"role": "user", "text": "Just a flu shot. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 31282, "end_ms": 32001}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks for clarifying, Dave. So, a flu shot appointment at 9:00 AM on Thursday, September 17th. Is that right? Should I go ahead and book it for you?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 32960, "end_ms": 40716}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yep. Correct. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 41152, "end_ms": 41711}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {"date": "2026-09-17", "reason": "flu shot", "time": "09:00", "patient_name": "Dave O"}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "confirmation_number": "CLN-D94B09", "booked": {"patient_name": "Dave O", "date": "2026-09-17", "time": "09:00", "reason"