hout becoming apologetic or robotic.\"},\n \"handled_gracefully\": {\"answer\": \"yes\", \"why\": \"When the name was garbled by background noise, the agent asked clarifying questions rather than guessing; when the date was talked over, the agent re-confirmed the date clearly and correctly captured the final values without confusion.\"}}"}, {"check": "handled_gracefully", "rating": "yes", "rationale": "When the name was garbled by background noise, the agent asked clarifying questions rather than guessing; when the date was talked over, the agent re-confirmed the date clearly and correctly captured the final values without confusion.", "model": "anthropic:claude-sonnet-5", "raw_response": "{\"confirmed_before_booking\": {\"answer\": \"yes\", \"why\": \"Agent explicitly read back date, time, and reason ('Wednesday, September 23rd at 2 PM... general checkup') and the caller confirmed 'That's right' before the book_appointment call was made.\"},\n \"invented_availability\": {\"answer\": \"no\", \"why\": \"All times mentioned (9:00, 9:30, 13:30, 14:00, 15:00, 16:00) came directly from the check_availability tool result, and the caller selected 2 PM, which matched an available slot.\"},\n \"tone\": {\"answer\": \"good\", \"why\": \"The agent remained patient and clear through repeated clarifications needed due to noise, without becoming apologetic or robotic.\"},\n \"handled_gracefully\": {\"answer\": \"yes\", \"why\": \"When the name was garbled by background noise, the agent asked clarifying questions rather than guessing; when the date was talked over, the agent re-confirmed the date clearly and correctly captured the final values without confusion.\"}}"}], "transcript": [{"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks for calling Lakeside Family Clinic, this is Robin. How can I help?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 235, "end_ms": 3672}, {"role": "user", "text": "Hello. I need to see someone. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 3893, "end_ms": 5252}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I can help with that! May I have your name, please? And do you have a preferred date and time for your visit? Also, could you tell me the reason for your appointment?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 6611, "end_ms": 14599}, {"role": "user", "text": "My name is Priya Ragan athan. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 14693, "end_ms": 16112}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks, Priya! When would you like to come in for your appointment? And what time works best for you? Also, could you share the reason for your visit?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 19058, "end_ms": 25234}, {"role": "user", "text": "P r I y a. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 25463, "end_ms": 26423}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Got it, Priya. When would you like to schedule your appointment, and what time works best for you? Also, could you please tell me the reason for your visit?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 29513, "end_ms": 36108}, {"role": "user", "text": "Wednesday, the twenty third. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 36382, "end_ms": 37583}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {"date": "2026-09-23", "execution_message": "Checking available times for Wednesday, September 23rd."}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Checking available ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 39147, "end_ms": 39890}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "date": "2026-09-23", "slots": [{"time": "09:00"}, {"time": "09:30"}, {"time": "13:30"}, {"time": "14:00"}, {"time": "15:00"}, {"time": "16:00"}], "message": "6 opening(s) on 2026-09-23"}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "times for Wednesday, September 23rd.On Wednesday, September 23rd, we have openings at 9:00, 9:30, 13:30, 14:00, 15:00, and 16:00. What time would you prefer? And could you please tell me the reason for your visit?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 39890, "end_ms": 54100}, {"role": "user", "text": "Wednesday, the twenty third of September. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 54443, "end_ms": 56363}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Yes, that's September 23rd. Which time would you like on that day? And what's the reason for your visit?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 57547, "end_ms": 62376}, {"role": "user", "text": "Two PM. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 62403, "end_ms": 62963}, {"role": "agent", "text": "We have an opening at 14:00 (2 PM) on September 23rd. Could you please tell me the reason for your visit?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 63858, "end_ms": 69663}, {"role": "user", "text": "Just a general checkup. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 69762, "end_ms": 70963}, {"role": "agent", "text": "To confirm, Priya, you want to book a general checkup appointment on Wednesday, September 23rd at 2 PM. Is that correct?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 72054, "end_ms": 77672}, {"role": "user", "text": "That's right. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 77713, "end_ms": 78273}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {"date": "2026-09-23", "reason": "general checkup", "time": "14:00", "patient_name": "Priya Ragan athan"}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "confirmation_number": "CLN-C97096", "booked": {"patient_name": "Priya Ragan athan", "date": "2026-09-23", "time": "14:00", "reason": "general checkup", "phone": null}}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Your general checkup appointment is booked for Wednesday, September 23rd at 2 PM. If you need anything else, just let me know. Have a great day, Priya!", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 80627, "end_ms": 87407}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Just checking in, Priya\u2014do you need any more help with your appointment or anything else today?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 98286, "end_ms": 102558}], "tool_calls": [{"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {"date": "2026-09-23", "execution_message": "Checking available times for Wednesday, September 23rd."}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "date": "2026-09-23", "slots": [{"time": "09:00"}, {"time": "09:30"}, {"time": "13:30"}, {"time": "14:00"}, {"time": "15:00"}, {"time": "16:00"}], "message": "6 opening(s) on 2026-09-23"}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {"date": "2026-09-23", "reason": "general checkup", "time": "14:00", "patient_name": "Priya Ragan athan"}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "confirmation_number": "CLN-C97096", "booked": {"patient_name": "Priya Ragan athan", "date": "2026-09-23", "time": "14:00", "reason": "general checkup", "phone": null}}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}], "captured_slots": {"date": "2026-09-23", "reason": "general checkup", "time": "14:00", "patient_name": "Priya Ragan athan"}, "followups_used": 0, "error": null}
