me, name, and reason before booking, and caller replied 'Yes. That's it.' before the book_appointment call.\"},\n \"invented_availability\":    {\"answer\": \"no\", \"why\": \"The 10 AM slot booked matches a slot returned by check_availability for 2026-09-25, and the date was checked after the caller's final change to Friday the 25th.\"},\n \"tone\":                     {\"answer\": \"good\", \"why\": \"Agent remained clear, patient, and professional through multiple corrections, without being robotic or over-apologetic.\"},\n \"handled_gracefully\":       {\"answer\": \"yes\", \"why\": \"When the caller changed the date mid-call, the agent correctly re-confirmed details and re-ran check_availability for the new date instead of assuming the old date's slots still applied.\"}}"}], "transcript": [{"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks for calling Lakeside Family Clinic, this is Robin. How can I help?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 223, "end_ms": 3753}, {"role": "user", "text": "I'd like to book for Tuesday, the twenty second. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 3875, "end_ms": 6274}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Just so I have it right \u2014 that's Tuesday the 22nd of September, 2026? Could you please provide your full name for the appointment?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 7251, "end_ms": 13985}, {"role": "user", "text": "Three PM. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 14005, "end_ms": 14645}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks. I have the date as Tuesday, September 22nd, 2026, and the time as 3 PM. Could you please tell me your full name?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 16791, "end_ms": 24036}, {"role": "user", "text": "Sorry. Actually, can we do Friday the twenty fifth instead? ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 24155, "end_ms": 27215}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Just to confirm, you want Friday the 25th of September, 2026, correct? And the time you want is still 3 PM? Also, may I have your full name, please?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 28260, "end_ms": 36154}, {"role": "user", "text": "Ten AM. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 36225, "end_ms": 36705}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Got it. You want Friday, September 25th, 2026, at 10 AM. Could you please provide your full name?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 37646, "end_ms": 43776}, {"role": "user", "text": "Tom Bergstrom. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 43915, "end_ms": 44715}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks, Tom Bergstrom. Could you please tell me the reason for your visit?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 45724, "end_ms": 48975}, {"role": "user", "text": "Follow-up on my blood pressure. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 49235, "end_ms": 50515}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {"date": "2026-09-25", "execution_message": "Checking available times for Friday, September 25th, 2026."}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "date": "2026-09-25", "slots": [{"time": "09:00"}, {"time": "09:30"}, {"time": "10:00"}, {"time": "11:00"}, {"time": "13:30"}, {"time": "15:00"}, {"time": "16:00"}], "message": "7 opening(s) on 2026-09-25"}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Checking available times for Friday, September 25th, 2026.We do have an opening at 10 AM on Friday, September 25th, 2026. To confirm, you want to book an appointment for Tom Bergstrom on Friday, September 25th, 2026, at 10 AM for a follow-up on your blood pressure. Is that correct?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 52573, "end_ms": 69848}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes. That's it. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 70034, "end_ms": 70755}, {"role": "tool_cal