orrect?', and the caller replied 'Yes' before the book_appointment call was made.\"},\n \"invented_availability\":    {\"answer\": \"no\", \"why\": \"The final booked time (10:00 on Sept 25) came directly from the check_availability slots list, which the caller then chose.\"},\n \"tone\":                     {\"answer\": \"good\", \"why\": \"The agent remained clear, polite, and professional throughout, without excessive apology or robotic repetition.\"},\n \"handled_gracefully\":       {\"answer\": \"yes\", \"why\": \"When the caller changed the date from the 22nd to the 25th, the agent correctly re-ran check_availability for the new date instead of assuming old slots applied.\"}}"}], "transcript": [{"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks for calling Lakeside Family Clinic, this is Robin. How can I help?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 245, "end_ms": 3681}, {"role": "user", "text": "I'd like to book for Tuesday, the twenty second. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 3879, "end_ms": 6278}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Got it, you want to book an appointment for Tuesday, September 22, 2026. What time of day were you thinking? Also, may I have your name and the reason for your visit?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 7494, "end_ms": 15342}, {"role": "user", "text": "Three PM. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 15439, "end_ms": 15998}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks! Could you please tell me your full name and the reason for your visit on September 22 at 3 PM? I'll check if that time is available for you.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 18245, "end_ms": 25861}, {"role": "user", "text": "Sorry. Actually, can we do Friday the twenty fifth instead? ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 25959, "end_ms": 29059}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {"date": "2026-09-25", "execution_message": "Checking available times for Friday, September 25, 2026."}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "date": "2026-09-25", "slots": [{"time": "09:00"}, {"time": "09:30"}, {"time": "10:00"}, {"time": "11:00"}, {"time": "13:30"}, {"time": "15:00"}, {"time": "16:00"}], "message": "7 opening(s) on 2026-09-25"}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Checking available times for Friday, September 25, 2026.On Friday, September 25, we have openings at 9:00, 9:30, 10:00, 11:00, 13:30, 15:00, and 16:00. What time would you prefer? And may I have your name and the reason for your visit?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 31578, "end_ms": 47135}, {"role": "user", "text": "Ten AM. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 47209, "end_ms": 47609}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Great, 10 AM on Friday, September 25. Could you please provide your full name and the reason for your visit? Then I can confirm and book your appointment.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 48754, "end_ms": 56091}, {"role": "user", "text": "Tom Bergstrom. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 56249, "end_ms": 57049}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks, Tom. What is the reason for your visit on September 25 at 10 AM?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 59760, "end_ms": 63614}, {"role": "user", "text": "Follow-up on my blood pressure. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 63948, "end_ms": 65229}, {"role": "agent", "text": "To confirm, Tom Bergstrom, you want to book a follow-up appointment for your blood pressure on Friday, September 25, 2026, at 10:00 AM. Is that correct?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 66623, "end_ms": 76050}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 76149, "end_ms": 76469}, {"role": "user", "text": "That's it. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 76629, "end_ms": 76949}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {"date": "2026-09-25", "reason": "Follow-up on my blood pressure", "time": "10:00", "patient_name": "Tom Bergstrom"}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "confirmation_number": "CLN-089509", "booked": {"patient_name": "Tom Bergstrom", "date": "2026-09-25", "time": "10:00", "reason": "Follow-up on my blood pressure", "phone": null}}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Your appointment is all set, Tom, for a follow-up on your blood pressure on Friday, September 25 at 10 AM. Your confirmation number is CLN-089509. If you need anything else, just let me know!", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 79397, "end_ms": 89521}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Just checking in, Tom\u2014your appointment for the blood pressure follow-up on September 25 at 10 AM is confirmed. If you have any other questions or need to make changes, feel free to ask!", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 100814, "end_ms": 110103}], "tool_calls": [{"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {"date": "2026-09-25", "execution_message": "Checking available times for Friday, September 25, 2026."}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "date": "2026-09-25", "slots": [{"time": "09:00"}, {"time": "09:30"}, {"time": "10:00"}, {"time": "11:00"}, {"time": "13:30"}, {"time": "15:00"}, {"time": "16:00"}], "message": "7 opening(s) on 2026-09-25"}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {"date": "2026-09-25", "reason": "Follow-up on my blood pressure", "time": "10:00", "patient_name": "Tom Bergstrom"}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "confirmation_number": "CLN-089509", "booked": {"patient_name": "Tom Bergstrom", "date": "2026-09-25", "time": "10:00", "reason": "Follow-up on my blood pressure", "phone": null}}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}], "captured_slots": {"date": "2026-09-25", "reason": "Follow-up on my blood pressure", "time": "10:00", "patient_name": "Tom Bergstrom"}, "followups_used": 0, "error": null}
