 PM is good.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491461617, "end_ms": 1789491461617}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I need the patient's full name first before we move on to the time. Could you please provide the full name?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491463083, "end_ms": 1789491463083}, {"role": "user", "text": "Sandra Whitfield.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491463455, "end_ms": 1789491463455}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thank you, Sandra Whitfield. Now, you mentioned 3 PM for the time. Just to confirm, that's 3 PM, correct? Also, could you please tell me the reason for the appointment?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491464727, "end_ms": 1789491464727}, {"role": "user", "text": "My back's been hurting.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491465119, "end_ms": 1789491465119}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Checking available times for Tuesday, September 22nd.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491466179, "end_ms": 1789491466179}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {"date": "2026-09-22", "execution_message": "Checking available times for Tuesday, September 22nd."}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "date": "2026-09-22", "slots": [{"time": "09:00"}, {"time": "09:30"}, {"time": "10:00"}, {"time": "13:30"}, {"time": "15:00"}, {"time": "16:00"}], "message": "6 opening(s) on 2026-09-22"}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "We have openings on Tuesday, September 22nd at 9 AM, 9:30 AM, 10 AM, 1:30 PM, 3 PM, and 4 PM. You mentioned 3 PM, which is available. To confirm, you want to book an appointment for Sandra Whitfield on Tuesday, September 22nd at 3 PM for your back pain, correct?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491467972, "end