sts multiple times without resolving the confusion.", "model": "anthropic:claude-sonnet-5", "raw_response": "{\"confirmed_before_booking\": {\"answer\": \"unclear\", \"why\": \"No book_appointment tool call occurs in the transcript, so there is no booking event to evaluate confirmation against.\"},\n \"invented_availability\":    {\"answer\": \"no\", \"why\": \"The only specific time mentioned, 2 PM, was proposed by the caller, and the agent otherwise relied on check_availability results (which returned no slots).\"},\n \"tone\":                     {\"answer\": \"good\", \"why\": \"The agent remained calm, clear, and non-repetitive in phrasing, asking straightforward clarifying questions without being overly apologetic.\"},\n \"handled_gracefully\":       {\"answer\": \"no\", \"why\": \"When the caller kept repeating 'Yes. That's correct.' without providing a new date, the agent got stuck in a loop, repeating similar clarification requests multiple times without resolving the confusion.\"}}"}], "transcript": [{"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks for calling Lakeside Family Clinic, this is Robin. How can I help?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 219, "end_ms": 3424}, {"role": "user", "text": "I'd like to come in on the third. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 3726, "end_ms": 5005}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Just so I have it right \u2014 that's Thursday the 3rd of September 2026? Or did you mean October 3rd?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 7016, "end_ms": 12171}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes. The third. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 12215, "end_ms": 13016}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks for confirming the date as Thursday, September 3rd, 2026. May I have your full name, please?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 14409, "end_ms": 19193}, {"role": "user", "text": "Oh, okay. What about Monday, the fifth then? ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 19296, "end_ms": 21456}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Just to confirm, you mean Monday, September 5th, 2026?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 22566, "end_ms": 25723}, {"role": "user", "text": "Two PM. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 25786, "end_ms": 26346}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Got it, Monday, September 5th, 2026 at 2 PM. May I have your full name, please? And also the reason for your visit?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 27332, "end_ms": 33229}, {"role": "user", "text": "Nadia Haddad. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 33425, "end_ms": 34226}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thank you, Nadia Haddad. You want an appointment Monday, September 5th, 2026 at 2 PM. What is the reason for your visit?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 36852, "end_ms": 43633}, {"role": "user", "text": "Sore throat, ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 43766, "end_ms": 44406}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {"date": "2026-09-05", "execution_message": "Checking available times for Monday, September 5th, 2026."}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "date": "2026-09-05", "slots": [], "message": "The clinic is closed on Saturday."}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Checking available times for Monday, September 5th, 2026.The clinic is actually closed on Monday, September 5th, 2026. Would you like to try a different date?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 47626, "end_ms": 55892}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, please. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 55986, "end_ms": 56546}, {"role": "agent", "text": "What other date would you like to try for your appointment?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 57366, "end_ms": 59735}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes. That's correct. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 59536, "end_ms": 60416}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I want to make sure I understand\u2014did you mean to confirm Monday, September 5th, 2026, or did you want to give me a new date for your appointment?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 62267, "end_ms": 67979}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes. That's correct. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 67855, "end_ms": 68735}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I want to be sure I have the right date for your appointment. Could you please tell me the exact date you want to book?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 70029, "end_ms": 74859}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes. That's correct. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 74666, "end_ms": 75626}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I\u2019m still not clear on the date you want. Could you please say the exact day and date again?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 76651, "end_ms": 80506}], "tool_calls": [{"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {"date": "2026-09-05", "execution_message": "Checking available times for Monday, September 5th, 2026."}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "date": "2026-09-05", "slots": [], "message": "The clinic is closed on Saturday."}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}], "captured_slots": {}, "followups_used": 3, "error": null}
