", \"why\": \"All times mentioned by the agent (9:00, 9:30, 10:00, 1:30, 2:00, 3:00, 4:00, and the final 1:30 booking) came directly from the check_availability tool result for October 5th; no time was fabricated outside that list, though the agent mistakenly claimed 2:00 PM was unavailable when it actually was in the slot list.\"},\n \"tone\":                     {\"answer\": \"acceptable\", \"why\": \"The agent was polite and clear throughout, but it made a factual error claiming 2:00 PM was unavailable when the tool result actually included that slot, causing avoidable conf"}], "transcript": [{"role": "user", "text": "I'd like to come in on the third.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491496903, "end_ms": 1789491496903}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks for letting me know! Just to confirm, you mean October 3rd, 2026, right? Also, could you please tell me your full name, the time you'd prefer, and the reason for your visit?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491497971, "end_ms": 1789491497971}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, the third.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491498339, "end_ms": 1789491498339}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Checking available appointment times for October 3rd, 2026.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491499254, "end_ms": 1789491499254}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {"date": "2026-10-03", "execution_message": "Checking available appointment times for October 3rd, 2026."}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "date": "2026-10-03", "slots": [], "message": "The clinic is closed on Saturday."}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "The clinic is actually closed on October 3rd, which is a Saturday. Would you like to try another date? If so, please let me know which day works