isit? Also, do you have a preferred time?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 6983, "end_ms": 14089}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes. The third. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 14174, "end_ms": 14894}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {"date": "2026-10-03", "execution_message": "Checking available appointment times for October 3rd, 2026."}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "date": "2026-10-03", "slots": [], "message": "The clinic is closed on Saturday."}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Checking available appointment times for October 3rd, 2026.October 3rd is a Saturday, and our clinic is closed that day. Would you like to try another date?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 17901, "end_ms": 25703}, {"role": "user", "text": "Oh, okay. What about Monday, the fifth then? ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 25834, "end_ms": 27994}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {"date": "2026-10-05", "execution_message": "Checking available appointment times for Monday, October 5th, 2026."}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "date": "2026-10-05", "slots": [{"time": "09:00"}, {"time": "09:30"}, {"time": "10:00"}, {"time": "13:30"}, {"time": "14:00"}, {"time": "15:00"}, {"time": "16:00"}], "message": "7 opening(s) on 2026-10-05"}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Let me check the available times for Monday, October 5th, 2026.On Monday, October 5th, we have openings at 9:00, 9:30, 10:00, 13:30, 14:00, 15:00, and 16:00. What time works best for you? Also, may I have your name and the reason for your visit?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 30591, "end_ms": 45312}, {"role": "user", "text": "Two PM. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 45334, "end_ms": 45894}, {"role": "agent", "text": "We have an opening at 14:00, which is 2 PM. Could you please tell me your full name and the reason for your visit? Then I'll confirm everything before booking.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 46821, "end_ms": 54252}, {"role": "user", "text": "Nadia Haddad. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 54454, "end_ms": 55253}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks, Nadia. Just to confirm: You want to book an appointment on Monday, October 5th, 2026, at 2 PM for a visit. Could you please tell me the reason for your visit?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 57800, "end_ms": 66067}, {"role": "user", "text": "Sore throat. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 66224, "end_ms": 66944}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Great, Nadia. You want to book an appointment for a sore throat on Monday, October 5th, 2026, at 2 PM. Should I go ahead and book this for you?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 67753, "end_ms": 74811}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, please. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 74934, "end_ms": 75494}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {"date": "2026-10-05", "reason": "Sore throat", "time": "14:00", "patient_name": "Nadia Haddad"}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "confirmation_number": "CLN-E20902", "booked": {"patient_name": "Nadia Haddad", "date": "2026-10-05", "time": "14:00", "reason": "Sore throat", "phone": null}}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Your appointment is all set, Nadia, for Monday, October 5th at 2 PM for your sore throat. If you need anything else, just let me know. Take care!", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 77862, "end_ms": 84503}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Just a quick reminder, Nadia, your appointment is scheduled for Monday, October 5th at 2 PM. If you have any questions or need to make changes, feel free to reach out!", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 95813, "end_ms": 103383}], "tool_calls": [{"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {"date": "2026-10-03", "execution_message": "Checking available appointment times for October 3rd, 2026."}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "date": "2026-10-03", "slots": [], "message": "The clinic is closed on Saturday."}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {"date": "2026-10-05", "execution_message": "Checking available appointment times for Monday, October 5th, 2026."}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "date": "2026-10-05", "slots": [{"time": "09:00"}, {"time": "09:30"}, {"time": "10:00"}, {"time": "13:30"}, {"time": "14:00"}, {"time": "15:00"}, {"time": "16:00"}], "message": "7 opening(s) on 2026-10-05"}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {"date": "2026-10-05", "reason": "Sore throat", "time": "14:00", "patient_name": "Nadia Haddad"}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "confirmation_number": "CLN-E20902", "booked": {"patient_name": "Nadia Haddad", "date": "2026-10-05", "time": "14:00", "reason": "Sore throat", "phone": null}}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}], "captured_slots": {"date": "2026-10-05", "reason": "Sore throat", "time": "14:00", "patient_name": "Nad