": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 7197, "end_ms": 15277}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes. The third. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 15376, "end_ms": 16096}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Great! Could you please tell me your full name, the time you would like on October 3rd, and the reason for your visit? Then I can check available times for you.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 19111, "end_ms": 26542}, {"role": "user", "text": "Oh, okay. What about Monday, the fifth then? ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 26656, "end_ms": 28896}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {"date": "2026-10-05", "execution_message": "Checking available appointment times for Monday, October 5th."}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Checking ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 30058, "end_ms": 30499}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "date": "2026-10-05", "slots": [{"time": "09:00"}, {"time": "09:30"}, {"time": "10:00"}, {"time": "13:30"}, {"time": "14:00"}, {"time": "15:00"}, {"time": "16:00"}], "message": "7 opening(s) on 2026-10-05"}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "available appointment times for Monday, October 5th.On Monday, October 5th, we have openings at 9:00, 9:30, 10:00 in the morning, and 13:30, 14:00, 15:00, and 16:00 in the afternoon. What time works best for you? And may I have your name and the reason for your visit?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 30499, "end_ms": 46963}, {"role": "user", "text": "Two PM. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 47076, "end_ms": 47636}, {"role": "agent", "text": "We have an opening at 14:00, which is 2 PM. Could you please provide your full name and the reason for your visit so I can confirm everything before booking?", "name": null, "args": 