_ms": 3529}, {"role": "user", "text": "Hi. I need an appointment. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 3733, "end_ms": 5114}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I can help with that. Can I have the full name of the patient for the appointment?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 5975, "end_ms": 9365}, {"role": "user", "text": "Thursday, the twenty fourth. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 9484, "end_ms": 10684}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Just to confirm, you mean Thursday, September 24th, 2026? And may I have the full name of the patient, please?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 12034, "end_ms": 17700}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Still there? Could you please confirm the patient's full name and if the date Thursday, September 24th, 2026, works for you?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 28721, "end_ms": 35454}, {"role": "user", "text": "Sorry. I'm back. One thirty PM. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 35564, "end_ms": 37244}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks for that. I have the date as Thursday, September 24th, 2026, and the time as 1:30 PM. Could you please provide the full name of the patient? Also, what is the reason for the appointment?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 38121, "end_ms": 48013}, {"role": "user", "text": "Ellis Moreau. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 48164, "end_ms": 48964}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks, Ellis Moreau. Could you please confirm the reason for the appointment?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 52899, "end_ms": 56382}, {"role": "user", "text": "Recurring migraines. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 56654, "end_ms": 57614}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {"date": "2026-09-24", "execution_message": "Checking available times for Thursday, September 24th, 2026."}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end