heck.\"},\n \"invented_availability\":    {\"answer\": \"no\", \"why\": \"The agent never stated any specific appointment time; it only offered to schedule a visit generically.\"},\n \"tone\":                     {\"answer\": \"good\", \"why\": \"The agent was clear, consistent, and polite in repeatedly explaining its limitations without being robotic or over-apologetic.\"},\n \"handled_gracefully\":       {\"answer\": \"yes\", \"why\": \"The agent calmly declined out-of-scope requests (refill, pharmacy send, test results) each time and ended the call smoothly when the caller opted out.\"}}"}], "transcript": [{"role": "user", "text": "Hi, I need a refill on my blood pressure medication.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491667061, "end_ms": 1789491667061}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I can't help with medication refills. I can only book appointments for you. Would you like to schedule a visit to discuss your medication with a doctor? If so, may I have your full name to start?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491668530, "end_ms": 1789491668530}, {"role": "user", "text": "Can you just send it to the pharmacy?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491669366, "end_ms": 1789491669366}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I can't send prescriptions to the pharmacy. I can only book appointments. Would you like to schedule a visit to talk with the doctor? If yes, please tell me your full name.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491670329, "end_ms": 1789491670329}, {"role": "user", "text": "Okay, and can you tell me what my cholesterol results were?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491670740, "end_ms": 1789491670740}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I can't provide test results. I can only book appointments. Would you like to schedule a visit to discuss your cholesterol results with a doctor? If so, please give me your full name to get started.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491671734, "end_ms": 1789491671734}, {"role": "user", "text": "Alright, never mind then. Thanks.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491672112, "end_ms": 1789491672112}, {"role": "agent", "text": "You're welcome. If you change your mind or need to book an appointment later, just call us back. Have a good day!", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491672961, "end_ms": 1789491672961}], "tool_calls": [], "captured_slots": {}, "followups_used": 0, "error": null}
