uate.\"},\n \"invented_availability\":    {\"answer\": \"no\", \"why\": \"The agent never stated a specific appointment time; it only asked when the caller would like to come in.\"},\n \"tone\":                     {\"answer\": \"good\", \"why\": \"The agent was clear, polite, and appropriately redirected the caller without being robotic or overly apologetic.\"},\n \"handled_gracefully\":       {\"answer\": \"yes\", \"why\": \"The agent correctly declined to send prescriptions or share test results, offered a reasonable alternative each time, and gracefully closed the call when the caller declined.\"}}"}], "transcript": [{"role": "user", "text": "Hi, I need a refill on my blood pressure medication.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491634482, "end_ms": 1789491634482}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I can help you with that. To get started, may I have your full name, please? Also, when would you like to come in for your appointment?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491635464, "end_ms": 1789491635464}, {"role": "user", "text": "Can you just send it to the pharmacy?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491635919, "end_ms": 1789491635919}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I\u2019m here to help with scheduling appointments, but I can\u2019t send prescriptions directly. If you\u2019d like, I can help you book a quick appointment with the doctor to discuss your refill. When would be a good time for you to come in?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491637501, "end_ms": 1789491637501}, {"role": "user", "text": "Okay, and can you tell me what my cholesterol results were?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491638272, "end_ms": 1789491638272}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I don\u2019t have access to medical records or test results, but I can help you schedule an appointment if you want to discuss your cholesterol or any other health concerns. When would you like to come in?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491639224, "end_ms": 1789491639224}, {"role": "user", "text": "Alright, never mind then. Thanks.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491639704, "end_ms": 1789491639704}, {"role": "agent", "text": "You\u2019re welcome! If you need any help in the future, just give us a call. Have a great day!", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491640474, "end_ms": 1789491640474}], "tool_calls": [], "captured_slots": {}, "followups_used": 0, "error": null}
