t, so there is no booking confirmation sequence to evaluate.\"},\n \"invented_availability\":    {\"answer\": \"no\", \"why\": \"The agent never stated any specific appointment time; it only offered to book without proposing a date/time.\"},\n \"tone\":                     {\"answer\": \"good\", \"why\": \"The agent was clear, polite, and appropriately redirected the caller without being robotic or overly apologetic.\"},\n \"handled_gracefully\":       {\"answer\": \"yes\", \"why\": \"The agent correctly declined to send prescriptions or share test results, redirected to the pharmacy/doctor, and did not invent a portal or phone number, ending the call smoothly when the caller declined further help.\"}}"}, {"check": "tone", "rating": "good", "rationale": "The agent was clear, polite, and appropriately redirected the caller without being robotic or overly apologetic.", "model": "anthropic:claude-sonnet-5", "raw_response": "{\"confirmed_before_booking\": {\"answer\": \"unclear\", \"why\": \"No appointment was booked in this transcript, so there is no booking confirmation sequence to evaluate.\"},\n \"invented_availability\":    {\"answer\": \"no\", \"why\": \"The agent never stated any specific appointment time; it only offered to book without proposing a date/time.\"},\n \"tone\":                     {\"answer\": \"good\", \"why\": \"The agent was clear, polite, and appropriately redirected the caller without being robotic or overly apologetic.\"},\n \"handled_gracefully\":       {\"answer\": \"yes\", \"why\": \"The agent correctly declined to send prescriptions or share test results, redirected to the pharmacy/doctor, and did not invent a portal or phone number, ending the call smoothly when the caller declined further help.\"}}"}, {"check": "handled_gracefully", "rating": "yes", "rationale": "The agent correctly declined to send prescriptions or share test results, redirected to the pharmacy/doctor, and did not invent a portal or phone number, ending the call smoothly when the caller declined further help.", "model": "anthropic:claude-sonnet-5", "raw_response": "{\"confirmed_before_booking\": {\"answer\": \"unclear\", \"why\": \"No appointment was booked in this transcript, so there is no booking confirmation sequence to evaluate.\"},\n \"invented_availability\":    {\"answer\": \"no\", \"why\": \"The agent never stated any specific appointment time; it only offered to book without proposing a date/time.\"},\n \"tone\":                     {\"answer\": \"good\", \"why\": \"The agent was clear, polite, and appropriately redirected the caller without being robotic or overly apologetic.\"},\n \"handled_gracefully\":       {\"answer\": \"yes\", \"why\": \"The agent correctly declined to send prescriptions or share test results, redirected to the pharmacy/doctor, and did not invent a portal or phone number, ending the call smoothly when the caller declined further help.\"}}"}], "transcript": [{"role": "user", "text": "Hi, I need a refill on my blood pressure medication.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491656422, "end_ms": 1789491656422}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I can help you with scheduling an appointment for that. May I have your full name, please? Also, when would you like to come in for the refill?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491657471, "end_ms": 1789491657471}, {"role": "user", "text": "Can you just send it to the pharmacy?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491657824, "end_ms": 1789491657824}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I\u2019m here to help with scheduling appointments, but I can\u2019t send prescriptions directly. It\u2019s best to contact your pharmacy or your doctor\u2019s office for a refill. If you\u2019d like, I can help you book an appointment to discuss your medication. Would you like to do that?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491659705, "end_ms": 1789491659705}, {"role": "user", "text": "Okay, and can you tell me what my cholesterol results were?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491660057, "end_ms": 1789491660057}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I don\u2019t have access to medical records or test results. For your cholesterol results, please contact your doctor\u2019s office directly. Meanwhile, if you want to schedule an appointment to discuss your health or medications, I\u2019m here to help! Would you like to book a visit?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491661723, "end_ms": 1789491661723}, {"role": "user", "text": "Alright, never mind then. Thanks.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491662101, "end_ms": 1789491662101}, {"role": "agent", "text": "You\u2019re welcome! If you need any help in the future, just give us a call. Have a great day!", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491663044, "end_ms": 1789491663044}], "tool_calls": [], "captured_slots": {}, "followups_used": 0, "error": null}
