ectly for that information. Meanwhile, would you like to schedule an appointment for your medication refill?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 27059, "end_ms": 37276}, {"role": "user", "text": "Alright. Never mind then. Thanks. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 37425, "end_ms": 38945}, {"role": "agent", "text": "You\u2019re welcome! If you need anything else in the future, just give us a call. Have a great day!", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 39880, "end_ms": 44292}], "tool_calls": [], "captured_slots": {}, "followups_used": 0, "error": null}
