l. Would you like to schedule that? If so, please tell me your full name.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 14354, "end_ms": 24896}, {"role": "user", "text": "Okay. And can you tell me what my cholesterol results were? ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 24924, "end_ms": 27824}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I don\u2019t have access to test results, but I can help you schedule an appointment to discuss your cholesterol and medication. Would you like to book a visit? If yes, please provide your full name.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 28716, "end_ms": 37958}, {"role": "user", "text": "Alright. Never mind then. Thanks. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 38135, "end_ms": 39495}, {"role": "agent", "text": "You\u2019re welcome! If you need anything else in the future, just give us a call. Have a great day!", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 40168, "end_ms": 44580}], "tool_calls": [], "captured_slots": {}, "followups_used": 0, "error": null}
