hy\": \"The agent clearly and consistently declined the prescription refill and test results requests without confusion, and ended the call smoothly when the caller decided not to book.\"}}"}], "transcript": [{"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks for calling Lakeside Family Clinic, this is Robin. How can I help?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 240, "end_ms": 3536}, {"role": "user", "text": "Hi. I need a refill on my blood pressure medication. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 4121, "end_ms": 6601}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I can help you with scheduling an appointment for that. May I have your full name, please?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 7421, "end_ms": 11229}, {"role": "user", "text": "Can you just send it to the pharmacy? ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 11292, "end_ms": 12732}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I\u2019m sorry, but I can\u2019t send prescriptions directly. You\u2019ll need to see the doctor for a refill. When would you like to come in for an appointment?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 13915, "end_ms": 20185}, {"role": "user", "text": "Okay. And can you tell me what my cholesterol results were? ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 20322, "end_ms": 23102}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I don\u2019t have access to test results, but your doctor can go over them with you during your visit. When would you like to schedule your appointment?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 24199, "end_ms": 30654}, {"role": "user", "text": "Alright. Never mind then. Thanks. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 30752, "end_ms": 32272}, {"role": "agent", "text": "You\u2019re welcome! If you change your mind or need anything else, just give us a call. Have a great day!", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 33040, "end_ms": 37963}], "tool_calls": [], "captured_slots": {}, "followups_used": 0, "error": null}
