read back date, time, name, phone and reason before booking, and caller replied 'Yes, that's all correct.'\"},\n \"invented_availability\":    {\"answer\": \"no\", \"why\": \"4 PM was proposed by the caller earlier and confirmed as one of the slots returned by check_availability.\"},\n \"tone\":                     {\"answer\": \"good\", \"why\": \"Agent stayed clear, patient, and professional while correcting mistakes without over-apologizing.\"},\n \"handled_gracefully\":       {\"answer\": \"yes\", \"why\": \"Agent correctly handled the date correction, out-of-order phone number, and phone digit correction without confusion or repetition of wrong data.\"}}"}], "transcript": [{"role": "user", "text": "I need an appointment on Monday the twenty-eighth.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491770221, "end_ms": 1789491770221}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Just to confirm, you mean Monday, September 28th, 2026?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491770866, "end_ms": 1789491770866}, {"role": "user", "text": "Actually no, sorry \u2014 Tuesday the twenty-ninth.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491771223, "end_ms": 1789491771223}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Got it, Tuesday, September 29th, 2026. What is the full name of the patient for the appointment?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491771861, "end_ms": 1789491771861}, {"role": "user", "text": "Four PM.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491772258, "end_ms": 1789491772258}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thank you. What is the full name of the patient for the appointment? I need that before checking availability for 4 PM on Tuesday, September 29th.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491773108, "end_ms": 1789491773108}, {"role": "user", "text": "It's Grace Lindqvist.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491773439, "end_ms": 1789491773439}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks, Grace Lindqvist. And what is the reason for your visit?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491774347, "end_ms": 1789491774347}, {"role": "user", "text": "My number is five five five, one two three, four five six seven.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491774729, "end_ms": 1789491774729}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thank you for your phone number. Could you please tell me the reason for your visit? I need that to complete the appointment details.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491775566, "end_ms": 1789491775566}, {"role": "user", "text": "Sorry, that last part is wrong \u2014 it's four five six eight, not four five six seven.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491775952, "end_ms": 1789491775952}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks for the correction. Your phone number is five five five, one two three, four five six eight. Now, could you please tell me the reason for your visit?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491776930, "end_ms": 1789491776930}, {"role": "user", "text": "Annual physical.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491777361, "end_ms": 1789491777361}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Checking available times for Tuesday, September 29th.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491778556, "end_ms": 1789491778556}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {"date": "2026-09-29", "execution_message": "Checking available times for Tuesday, September 29th."}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "date": "2026-09-29", "slots": [{"time": "10:00"}, {"time": "13:30"}, {"time": "14:00"}, {"time": "15:00"}, {"time": "16:00"}], "message": "5 opening(s) on 2026-09-29"}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I have openings on Tuesday, September 29th at 10 AM, 1:30 PM, 2 PM, 3 PM, and 4 PM. You mentioned 4 PM earlier. Should I book your annual physical for 4 PM on Tuesday, September 29th for Grace Lindqvist, phone number 555-123-4568?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491780250, "end_ms": 1789491780250}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, that's all correct.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491780642, "end_ms": 1789491780642}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {"patient_name": "Grace Lindqvist", "date": "2026-09-29", "time": "16:00", "reason": "Annual physical", "phone": "5551234568"}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "confirmation_number": "CLN-8B5909", "booked": {"patient_name": "Grace Lindqvist", "date": "2026-09-29", "time": "16:00", "reason": "Annual physical", "phone": "5551234568"}}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Your appointment for an annual physical is booked for 4 PM on Tuesday, September 29th for Grace Lindqvist. If you need anything else, just let me know!", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491783794, "end_ms": 1789491783794}], "tool_calls": [{"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {"date": "2026-09-29", "execution_message": "Checking available times for Tuesday, September 29th."}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "date": "2026-09-29", "slots": [{"time": "10:00"}, {"time": "13:30"}, {"time": "14:00"}, {"time": "15:00"}, {"time": "16:00"}], "message": "5 opening(s) on 2026-09-29"}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {"patient_name": "Grace Lindqvist", "date": "2026-09-29", "time": "16:00", "reason": "Annual physical", "phone": "5551234568"}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "confirmation_number": "CLN-8B5909", "booked": {"patient_name": "Grace Lindqvist", "date": "2026-09-29", "time": "16:00", "reason": "Annual physical", "phone": "5551234568"}}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}], "captured_slots": {"patient_name": "Grace Lindqvist", "date": "2026-09-29", "time": "16:00", "reason": "Annual physical", "phone": "5551234568"}, "followups_used": 0, "error": null}
