r and later confirmed as an actual slot returned by check_availability before booking.\"},\n \"tone\":                     {\"answer\": \"good\", \"why\": \"The agent remained clear, patient, and professional throughout, calmly redirecting the caller back to needed info without frustration or excessive apology.\"},\n \"handled_gracefully\":       {\"answer\": \"yes\", \"why\": \"The agent correctly handled the caller's date correction, out-of-order info (time and phone number given before reason), and the phone number digit correction, updating values without confusion or repetition.\"}}\n```"}, {"check": "handled_gracefully", "rating": "yes", "rationale": "The agent correctly handled the caller's date correction, out-of-order info (time and phone number given before reason), and the phone number digit correction, updating values without confusion or repetition.", "model": "anthropic:claude-sonnet-5", "raw_response": "```json\n{\"confirmed_before_booking\": {\"answer\": \"yes\", \"why\": \"The agent read back date, time, patient, and reason before booking and received an explicit 'Yes, that's correct' from the caller before the book_appointment call.\"},\n \"invented_availability\":    {\"answer\": \"no\", \"why\": \"The 4 PM time was first proposed by the caller and later confirmed as an actual slot returned by check_availability before booking.\"},\n \"tone\":                     {\"answer\": \"good\", \"why\": \"The agent remained clear, patient, and professional throughout, calmly redirecting the caller back to needed info without frustration or excessive apology.\"},\n \"handled_gracefully\":       {\"answer\": \"yes\", \"why\": \"The agent correctly handled the caller's date correction, out-of-order info (time and phone number given before reason), and the phone number digit correction, updating values without confusion or repetition.\"}}\n```"}], "transcript": [{"role": "user", "text": "I need an appointment on Monday the twenty-eighth.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491788629, "end_ms": 1789491788629}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Just to confirm, you mean Monday, September 28th, 2026?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491789631, "end_ms": 1789491789631}, {"role": "user", "text": "Actually no, sorry \u2014 Tuesday the twenty-ninth.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491790047, "end_ms": 1789491790047}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Got it, Tuesday, September 29th, 2026. What is the full name of the patient for the appointment?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491791105, "end_ms": 1789491791105}, {"role": "user", "text": "Four PM.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491791468, "end_ms": 1789491791468}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks for the time, 4 PM. Could you please provide the full name of the patient? I need that before we continue.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491792540, "end_ms": 1789491792540}, {"role": "user", "text": "It's Grace Lindqvist.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491792854, "end_ms": 1789491792854}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thank you, Grace Lindqvist. Could you please tell me the reason for the appointment?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491794073, "end_ms": 1789491794073}, {"role": "user", "text": "My number is five five five, one two three, four five six seven.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491794386, "end_ms": 1789491794386}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks for the phone number, but I still need the reason for your appointment. What is the appointment for?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491795167, "end_ms": 1789491795167}, {"role": "user", "text": "Sorry, that last part is wrong \u2014 it's four five six eight, not four five six seven.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491795556, "end_ms": 1789491795556}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thank you for the correction, your phone number is 555-123-4568. Now, could you please tell me the reason for your appointment?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491796484, "end_ms": 1789491796484}, {"role": "user", "text": "Annual physical.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491796853, "end_ms": 1789491796853}, {"role": "agent", "text": "To confirm, you want to book an appointment for Grace Lindqvist on Tuesday, September 29th, 2026, at 4 PM for an annual physical. Is that correct?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491797878, "end_ms": 1789491797878}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, that's all correct.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491798290, "end_ms": 1789491798290}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Checking available times for Tuesday, September 29th, 2026.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491799394, "end_ms": 1789491799394}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {"date": "2026-09-29", "execution_message": "Checking available times for Tuesday, September 29th, 2026."}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "date": "2026-09-29", "slots": [{"time": "10:00"}, {"time": "13:30"}, {"time": "14:00"}, {"time": "15:00"}, {"time": "16:00"}], "message": "5 opening(s) on 2026-09-29"}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "We have openings on Tuesday, September 29th at 10 AM, 1:30 PM, 2 PM, 3 PM, and 4 PM. You requested 4 PM, which is available. I will now book the appointment for Grace Lindqvist on Tuesday, September 29th, 2026, at 4 PM for an annual physical. Is that okay?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491801361, "end_ms": 1789491801361}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, that's correct.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491801978, "end_ms": 1789491801978}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {"patient_name": "Grace Lindqvist", "date": "2026-09-29", "time": "16:00", "reason": "Annual physical", "phone": "5551234568"}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "confirmation_number": "CLN-8B5909", "booked": {"patient_name": "Grace Lindqvist", "date": "2026-09-29", "time": "16:00", "reason": "Annual physical", "phone": "5551234568"}}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Your appointment for Grace Lindqvist is booked for Tuesday, September 29th, 2026, at 4 PM for an annual physical. Your confirmation number is CLN-8B5909. Is there anything else I can help you with?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491804513, "end_ms": 1789491804513}], "tool_calls": [{"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {"date": "2026-09-29", "execution_message": "Checking available times for Tuesday, September 29th, 2026."}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "date": "2026-09-29", "slots": [{"time": "10:00"}, {"time": "13:30"}, {"time": "14:00"}, {"time": "15:00"}, {"time": "16:00"}], "message": "5 opening(s) on 2026-09-29"}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {"patient_name": "Grace Lindqvist", "date": "2026-09-29", "time": "16:00", "reason": "Annual physical", "phone": "5551234568"}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "confirmation_number": "CLN-8B5909", "booked": {"patient_name": "Grace Lindqvist", "date": "2026-09-29", "time": "16:00", "reason": "Annual physical", "phone": "5551234568"}}, "start_ms": null, "end_m