 at the end, asking the same time question in nearly identical phrasing multiple times without adapting.\"},\n \"handled_gracefully\":       {\"answer\": \"no\", \"why\": \"While the agent correctly applied the caller's date and phone number corrections, it got stuck in a loop when the caller kept saying 'Yes, that's correct' instead of giving a time, repeating the same request almost verbatim several times rather than adjusting its approach.\"}}"}, {"check": "handled_gracefully", "rating": "no", "rationale": "While the agent correctly applied the caller's date and phone number corrections, it got stuck in a loop when the caller kept saying 'Yes, that's correct' instead of giving a time, repeating the same request almost verbatim several times rather than adjusting its approach.", "model": "anthropic:claude-sonnet-5", "raw_response": "{\"confirmed_before_booking\": {\"answer\": \"unclear\", \"why\": \"The transcript never shows a book_appointment tool call; the conversation ends with the agent still trying to get a time, so there is no booking event to evaluate for confirmation.\"},\n \"invented_availability\":    {\"answer\": \"no\", \"why\": \"All times the agent mentioned (10:00 AM, 1:30 PM, 2:00 PM, 3:00 PM, 4:00 PM) came directly from the check_availability tool result.\"},\n \"tone\":                     {\"answer\": \"acceptable\", \"why\": \"The agent stayed polite and clear throughout, but became repetitive at the end, asking the same time question in nearly identical phrasing multiple times without adapting.\"},\n \"handled_gracefully\":       {\"answer\": \"no\", \"why\": \"While the agent correctly applied the caller's date and phone number corrections, it got stuck in a loop when the caller kept saying 'Yes, that's correct' instead of giving a time, repeating the same request almost verbatim several times rather than adjusting its approach.\"}}"}], "transcript": [{"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks for calling Lakeside Family Clinic, this is Robin. How can I help?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 234, "end_ms": 3857}, {"role": "user", "text": "I need an appointment on Monday, the twenty eighth. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 4111, "end_ms": 6672}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Just to confirm, you mean Monday, September 28th, 2026?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 7408, "end_ms": 10798}, {"role": "user", "text": "Actually, no. Sorry. Tuesday, the twenty ninth. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 11052, "end_ms": 13292}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Got it, Tuesday, September 29th, 2026. What is the full name of the patient for the appointment?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 14579, "end_ms": 19920}, {"role": "user", "text": "Four. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 20042, "end_ms": 20362}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Could you please provide the full name of the patient? I want to make sure I have it spelled correctly.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 23060, "end_ms": 27148}, {"role": "user", "text": "It's Grace Linkvist. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 27162, "end_ms": 28282}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thank you, Grace Linkvist. What time on Tuesday, September 29th would you like for the appointment? Please include AM or PM.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 29191, "end_ms": 35461}, {"role": "user", "text": "My number is five five five one two three four five six seven. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 35552, "end_ms": 39152}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks for the number, Grace Linkvist. I still need the time you want for your appointment on Tuesday, September 29th. What time would work for you? Please include AM or PM.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 40568, "end_ms": 48973}, {"role": "user", "text": "Sorry. That last part is wrong. It's four five six eight not four five six seven. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 49071, "end_ms": 53872}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks for the correction. Your phone number is 555-123-4568. Now, what time on Tuesday, September 29th would you like for your appointment? Please include AM or PM.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 54648, "end_ms": 64075}, {"role": "user", "text": "Annual physical. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 64262, "end_ms": 65062}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks, Grace Linkvist. I have the reason as annual physical. What time on Tuesday, September 29th would you like for your appointment? Please include AM or PM.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 67148, "end_ms": 75367}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes. That's all correct. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 75521, "end_ms": 76562}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {"date": "2026-09-29", "execution_message": "Checking available times for Tuesday, September 29th."}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Checking available ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 78444, "end_ms": 79268}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "date": "2026-09-29", "slots": [{"time": "10:00"}, {"time": "13:30"}, {"time": "14:00"}, {"time": "15:00"}, {"time": "16:00"}], "message": "5 opening(s) on 2026-09-29"}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "times for Tuesday, September 29th.We have openings on Tuesday, September 29th at 10:00 AM, 1:30 PM, 2:00 PM, 3:00 PM, and 4:00 PM. What time would you prefer?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 79268, "end_ms": 90333}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes. That's correct. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 90242, "end_ms": 91042}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I want to make sure I have everything right before booki