xt": "Just to confirm, you mean Monday, September 28th, 2026?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 7574, "end_ms": 10685}, {"role": "user", "text": "Actually, no. Sorry. Tuesday, the twenty ninth. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 10887, "end_ms": 13127}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Got it, Tuesday, September 29th, 2026. May I have the full name for the appointment?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 14177, "end_ms": 18403}, {"role": "user", "text": "Four. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 18477, "end_ms": 18717}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I didn't catch that clearly. Could you please spell out the full name for the appointment?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 21872, "end_ms": 25401}, {"role": "user", "text": "It's Grace Linkvist. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 25477, "end_ms": 26517}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thank you, Grace Linkvist. What time on Tuesday, September 29th would you prefer? Please include AM or PM.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 27300, "end_ms": 33012}, {"role": "user", "text": "My number is five five five one two three four five six seven. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 33157, "end_ms": 36756}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks for your number, Grace Linkvist. I still need the time you want for your appointment on Tuesday, September 29th, and the reason for your visit. What time would you like? Please include AM or PM.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 37829, "end_ms": 47954}, {"role": "user", "text": "Sorry. That last part is wrong. It's four five six eight. Not four five six seven. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 48067, "end_ms": 52797}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks for the correction on your number: five five five one two three four five six eight. Now, could you please tell me the time you want for your appointment on Tuesday, September 29th, including AM or PM? Also, what is the reason for your visit?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 53890, "end_ms": 66336}, {"role": "user", "text": "Annual physical. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 66547, "end_ms": 67347}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks, Grace Linkvist. To recap: you want an appointment on Tuesday, September 29th, 2026, for an annual physical. I still need the time you prefer, including AM or PM. What time works for you?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 68498, "end_ms": 79411}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes. That's all correct. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 79597, "end_ms": 80557}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I still need the time you want for your appointment on Tuesday, September 29th, for the annual physical. What time would you like? Please include AM or PM.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 82568, "end_ms": 90137}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes. That's correct. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 90007, "end_ms": 90887}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I want to make sure I have everything before booking. You want an appointment for Grace Linkvist on Tuesday, September 29th, 2026, for an annual physical. I still need the time you want, including AM or PM. Could you please tell me the time?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 91814, "end_ms": 104586}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes. That's correct. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 104417, "end_ms": 105457}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I understand the details are correct except the time is still missing. Could you please tell me what time you would like for your appointment on Tuesday, September 29th? Please include AM or PM.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 106443, "end_ms": 115499}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Still there? I just need the time you want for your appointment on Tuesday, September 29th.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 126317, "end_ms": 130543}], "tool_calls": [], "captured_slots": {}, "followups_used": 2, "error": null}
