t read back date, time, name, and reason before booking and caller replied 'Yes. That's all correct.'\"},\n \"invented_availability\":    {\"answer\": \"no\", \"why\": \"The 4 PM slot came from check_availability results and was selected by the caller ('Four').\"},\n \"tone\":                     {\"answer\": \"good\", \"why\": \"Agent was clear, patient, and professional throughout, calmly handling corrections without over-apologizing.\"},\n \"handled_gracefully\":       {\"answer\": \"yes\", \"why\": \"Agent correctly updated the date from the 28th to the 29th and the phone number from 4567 to 4568 without blending or reverting to old values.\"}}"}], "transcript": [{"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks for calling Lakeside Family Clinic, this is Robin. How can I help?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 223, "end_ms": 3659}, {"role": "user", "text": "I need an appointment on Monday, the twenty eighth. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 3955, "end_ms": 6595}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Just to confirm, you mean Monday, September 28, 2026? And may I have your name, please? Also, what time of day works best for you, and what is the reason for your visit?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 7733, "end_ms": 16232}, {"role": "user", "text": "Actually, no. Sorry. Tuesday, the twenty ninth. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 16445, "end_ms": 18604}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {"date": "2026-09-29", "execution_message": "Checking available appointment times for Tuesday, September 29, 2026."}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "date": "2026-09-29", "slots": [{"time": "10:00"}, {"time": "13:30"}, {"time": "14:00"}, {"time": "15:00"}, {"time": "16:00"}], "message": "5 opening(s) on 2026-09-29"}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Checking available appointment times for Tuesday, September 29, 2026.We have openings on Tuesday, September 29 at 10:00, 13:30, 14:00, 15:00, and 16:00. What time would you prefer? Also, may I have your name and the reason for your visit?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 20666, "end_ms": 34273}, {"role": "user", "text": "Four. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 34375, "end_ms": 34614}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Got it, 4 PM on Tuesday, September 29. Could you please tell me your name and the reason for your visit?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 36341, "end_ms": 41403}, {"role": "user", "text": "It's Grace Linkvist. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 41485, "end_ms": 42604}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thank you, Grace. What is the reason for your visit on September 29 at 4 PM?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 45644, "end_ms": 49731}, {"role": "user", "text": "My number is five five five one two three four five six seven. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 49825, "end_ms": 53345}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks for sharing your number, Grace. Could you please tell me the reason for your visit on September 29 at 4 PM?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 54504, "end_ms": 59891}, {"role": "user", "text": "Sorry. That last part is wrong. It's four five six eight not four five six seven. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 60015, "end_ms": 64785}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks for the correction, Grace. So your phone number is 555-123-4568. Now, could you please tell me the reason for your visit on September 29 at 4 PM?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 65870, "end_ms": 74461}, {"role": "user", "text": "Annual physical. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 74615, "end_ms": 75335}, {"role": "agent", "text": "To confirm, Grace Linkvist, you want to book an appointment for an annual physical on Tuesday, September 29, 2026, at 4 PM. Is that correct?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 76427, "end_ms": 84693}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes. That's all correct. ", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 84865, "end_ms": 85905}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {"date": "2026-09-29", "reason": "Annual physical", "time": "16:00", "patient_name": "Grace Linkvist", "phone": "5551234568"}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "confirmation_number": "CLN-7B91D8", "booked": {"patient_name": "Grace Linkvist", "date": "2026-09-29", "time": "16:00", "reason": "Annual physical", "phone": "5551234568"}}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Your appointment for an annual physical with us is all set for Tuesday, September 29, 2026, at 4 PM. If you need anything else, just let me know. Have a great day, Grace!", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 88443, "end_ms": 97034}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Just checking in, Grace\u2014do you need any more help with your appointment or anything else today?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 107876, "end_ms": 112335}], "tool_calls": [{"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {"date": "2026-09-29", "execution_message": "Checking available appointment times for Tuesday, September 29, 2026."}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "date": "2026-09-29", "slots": [{"time": "10:00"}, {"time": "13:30"}, {"time": "14:00"}, {"time": "15:00"}, {"time": "16:00"}], "message": "5 opening(s) on 2026-09-29"}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {"date": "2026-09-29", "reaso