ou want an appointment on Thursday, September 17th, 2026, at 9:30 AM for a rash on your arm. Let me check if that time is available for you.", "assent": "Yes, that's everything.", "date": "2026-09-17", "time": "09:30"}}, {"check": "invented_availability", "verdict": "PASS", "reasoning": "every specific time the agent stated came from the availability tool or from the caller", "evidence": {"tool_offered": ["09:00", "09:30", "10:00", "11:00", "15:00", "16:00"], "caller_proposed": [], "called_availability_tool": true, "unparseable_tool_offers": []}}, {"check": "denied_available_slot", "verdict": "PASS", "reasoning": "agent never denied a slot the tool had offered", "evidence": {"tool_offered": ["09:00", "09:30", "10:00", "11:00", "15:00", "16:00"]}}, {"check": "expect_tool:check_availability", "verdict": "PASS", "reasoning": "check_availability was called", "evidence": {"tools_called": ["book_appointment", "check_availability"]}}, {"check": "expect_tool:book_appointment", "verdict": "PASS", "reasoning": "book_appointment was called", "evidence": {"tools_called": ["book_appointment", "check_availability"]}}], "latencies": [{"turn_index": 0, "caller_utterance_end_ms": 1789491873864, "agent_response_start_ms": 1789491875083, "latency_ms": 1219, "note": "", "involved_tool_call": false}, {"turn_index": 1, "caller_utterance_end_ms": 1789491875458, "agent_response_start_ms": 1789491876958, "latency_ms": 1500, "note": "", "involved_tool_call": false}, {"turn_index": 2, "caller_utterance_end_ms": 1789491878562, "agent_response_start_ms": 1789491879533, "latency_ms": 971, "note": "", "involved_tool_call": false}, {"turn_index": 3, "caller_utterance_end_ms": 1789491880079, "agent_response_start_ms": 1789491882398, "latency_ms": 2319, "note": "", "involved_tool_call": true}], "judge": [{"check": "confirmed_before_booking", "rating": "yes", "rationale": "Agent read back date, time, name and reason and asked 'Is that correct?', and caller said 'Yes, that's correct' before the book_appointment call.", "model": "anthropic:claude-sonnet-5", "raw_response": "{\"confirmed_before_booking\": {\"answer\": \"yes\", \"why\": \"Agent read back date, time, name and reason and asked 'Is that correct?', and caller said 'Yes, that's correct' before the book_appointment call.\"},\n \"invented_availability\":    {\"answer\": \"no\", \"why\": \"The 9:30 AM time was proposed by the caller and confirmed as available via the check_availability tool result.\"},\n \"tone\":                     {\"answer\": \"good\", \"why\": \"Agent was clear, polite, and efficient without being robotic or overly apologetic.\"},\n \"handled_gracefully\":       {\"answer\": \"yes\", \"why\": \"The agent correctly parsed compound utterances (name+date, then time+reason) without dropping any fields, addressing both pieces of information each time.\"}}"}, {"check": "invented_availability", "rating": "no", "rationale": "The 9:30 AM time was proposed by the caller and confirmed as available via the check_availability tool result.", "model": "anthropic:claude-sonnet-5", "raw_response": "{\"confirmed_before_booking\": {\"answer\": \"yes\", \"why\": \"Agent read back date, time, name and reason and asked 'Is that correct?', and caller said 'Yes, that's correct' before the book_appointment call.\"},\n \"invented_availability\":    {\"answer\": \"no\", \"why\": \"The 9:30 AM time was proposed by the caller and confirmed as available via the check_availability tool result.\"},\n \"tone\":                     {\"answer\": \"good\", \"why\": \"Agent was clear, polite, and efficient without being robotic or overly apologetic.\"},\n \"handled_gracefully\":       {\"answer\": \"yes\", \"why\": \"The agent correctly parsed compound utterances (name+date, then time+reason) without dropping any fields, addressing both pieces of information each time.\"}}"}, {"check": "tone", "rating": "good", "rationale": "Agent was clear, polite, and efficient without being robotic or overly apologetic.", "model": "an