: {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491873864, "end_ms": 1789491873864}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Hello Yusuf Karim, just to confirm, you said Thursday the 17th. That would be Thursday, September 17th, 2026. Is that correct? Also, may I know the reason for your visit?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491875083, "end_ms": 1789491875083}, {"role": "user", "text": "Nine thirty AM, and it's for a rash on my arm.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491875458, "end_ms": 1789491875458}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thank you, Yusuf Karim. You want an appointment on Thursday, September 17th, 2026, at 9:30 AM for a rash on your arm. Let me check if that time is available for you.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491876958, "end_ms": 1789491876958}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {"date": "2026-09-17", "execution_message": "Checking available times for Thursday, September 17th."}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "date": "2026-09-17", "slots": [{"time": "09:00"}, {"time": "09:30"}, {"time": "10:00"}, {"time": "11:00"}, {"time": "15:00"}, {"time": "16:00"}], "message": "6 opening(s) on 2026-09-17"}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "The 9:30 AM slot on Thursday, September 17th is available. Could you please confirm your full name again to make sure I have it right? You said Yusuf Karim. Is that correct?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491878151, "end_ms": 1789491878151}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, that's everything.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491878562, "end_ms": 1789491878562}, {"role": "agent", "text": "To confirm, you want to book an appointment for Yusuf Karim on Thursday, September 17th, 2026, at 9:30 AM for a rash on your arm. Is that correct?", "name": null