s a rash on your arm?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491903779, "end_ms": 1789491903779}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, that's everything.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491904158, "end_ms": 1789491904158}, {"role": "agent", "text": "To confirm, I have Yusuf Karim for the full name, an appointment on Thursday, September 17th, 2026, at 9:30 AM, and the reason is a rash on your arm. Should I go ahead and book this appointment for you?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491905242, "end_ms": 1789491905242}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, that's correct.", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491905708, "end_ms": 1789491905708}, {"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {"patient_name": "Yusuf Karim", "date": "2026-09-17", "time": "09:30", "reason": "rash on arm"}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "book_appointment", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "confirmation_number": "CLN-863834", "booked": {"patient_name": "Yusuf Karim", "date": "2026-09-17", "time": "09:30", "reason": "rash on arm", "phone": null}}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Your appointment is booked for Thursday, September 17th, 2026, at 9:30 AM with us for the rash on your arm. Your confirmation number is CLN-863834. Is there anything else I can help you with today?", "name": null, "args": {}, "result": {}, "start_ms": 1789491907714, "end_ms": 1789491907714}], "tool_calls": [{"role": "tool_call", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {"date": "2026-09-17", "execution_message": "Checking available times for Thursday, September 17th."}, "result": {}, "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"role": "tool_result", "text": "", "name": "check_availability", "args": {}, "result": {"ok": true, "date": "2026-09-17", "slots": [{"time": "09:00"}, {"time": "09:30"}, {"time": "10:00"}, {"time": "1